id: snack-motivated
name: Snack Motivated
order: 16
category: mind
importance: secondary
# (1) The Snack Fiend Talent, given with the Trait and kept if it is lost - not written yet, so named when gained.
grantsTalent: snack-fiend
description: >
  With a body powered by sugary sweets and a bottomless appetite, it turns out that you’ll do almost anything for a tasty treat.
text: >
  Snack Motivated (Mind): With a body powered by sugary sweets and a bottomless appetite, it turns out that you’ll do almost anything for a tasty treat.
  (1)-[Passive]: Gain access to the Snack Fiend Talent.
  (2)-[Passive]: Double the amount of Life and Ki Points regained from the Snack Basic Item.
  (3)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: If you’ve used the Snack Basic Item during this Combat Round, gain an additional stack of Power through this use of the Power Up Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (2) What a Snack's rolls give back, doubled (the Gear tab's consume).
allow snack.double;

# (3) The Power Up's window, after a Snack eaten this Combat Round: a stack of Power more.
[triggered/power, 1/round, effect 3]
requires snackThisRound;
power.stacks += 1;
